#OSI MODEL:
The OSI model (open system interconnection) model has seven layers:
1. Application
2. Presentation
3. Session
4. Transport
5. Network
6. Data link
7. Physical
## Important Cybersecurity layers:
- Transport layer: TCP,UDP,PORTS 
-Network layer: IP address and routing
-Data link layer: MAC address and frames
-Application layer: protocols such as HTTP/HTTPS AND DNS.
